{"id":"76af324ae3acb27e","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-one-way-function.md","title":"df-one-way-function (One-Way Function)","display":"df-one-way-function (One-Way Function)","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","display":"df-one-way-function (One-Way Function)","label":"28-df-one-way-function","type":"definition","aliases":["28-df-one-way-function","OWF","One-Way Function"],"depends_on":["[[28-df-negl]]","[[28-df-ppt]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]"],"source_book_location":"Definition 9.4; printed p.177; PDF p.203","source_printed_pages":"177","source_pdf_pages":"203","source_status":"local-interface-correction","source_statement_verified":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"display","html":"df-one-way-function (One-Way Function)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-one-way-function"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-one-way-function</span><span>OWF</span><span>One-Way Function</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f3171800627deef3\" href=\"?note=f3171800627deef3\" title=\"28-df-negl\">28-df-negl</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Definition 9.4; printed p.177; PDF p.203"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"177"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"203"},{"key":"source_status","html":"local-interface-correction"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\">\\(f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\">\\(A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\)</span> 是均匀随机求逆算法，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a>；求逆输入为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(1^n,f(x))\">\\((1^n,f(x))\\)</span>，二输入调用采用该文件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tup}_2=\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\">\\(\\operatorname{tup}_2=\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\\)</span> 编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n\">\\(U_n\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^n\">\\(\\Sigma^n\\)</span> 上均匀分布。概率同时取遍 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的独立随机性。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Negl}\">\\(\\mathrm{Negl}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f3171800627deef3\" href=\"?note=f3171800627deef3\" title=\"28-df-negl\">28-df-negl</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InvAdv}_{A,f}:\\mathbb N\\to[0,1]\">\\(\\operatorname{InvAdv}_{A,f}:\\mathbb N\\to[0,1]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{OWF}\">\\(\\mathbf{OWF}\\)</span> 为强单向函数类。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InvAdv}_{A,f}(n)\\coloneqq\\Pr_{x\\leftarrow U_n}\\left[f\\bigl(A(1^n,f(x))\\bigr)=f(x)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{InvAdv}_{A,f}(n)\\coloneqq\\Pr_{x\\leftarrow U_n}\\left[f\\bigl(A(1^n,f(x))\\bigr)=f(x)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{OWF}\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathbf{FP}:\\forall A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\;\\operatorname{InvAdv}_{A,f}\\in\\mathrm{Negl}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{OWF}\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathbf{FP}:\\forall A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\;\\operatorname{InvAdv}_{A,f}\\in\\mathrm{Negl}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>成功是找到任意原像，不要求恢复抽样的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，也不限制原像必须与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 等长。安全参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1^n\">\\(1^n\\)</span> 在正式实验中显式提供，运行时间由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+|f(x)|\">\\(n+|f(x)|\\)</span> 控制；因此保持一般字符串函数的候选域，不额外加入保长限制。</p>\n<p>原仅输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x)\">\\(f(x)\\)</span> 且无长度前提的接口会产生退化：取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x)=\\operatorname{bin}(|x|)\">\\(f(x)=\\operatorname{bin}(|x|)\\)</span>，任何原像长度必须为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，但仅见长 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(\\log n)\">\\(O(\\log n)\\)</span> 输入的 PPT 最多输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{poly}(\\log n)\">\\(\\operatorname{poly}(\\log n)\\)</span> 位，于是该简单函数也被错误判为单向。显式提供 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1^n\">\\(1^n\\)</span> 后，求逆器输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0^n\">\\(0^n\\)</span> 即成功。本修订是对一般函数安全接口的必要校正，未声称本次重新核对原书 PDF。</p>\n<p>R7来源边界：PDF203 的 Definition 9.4 将成功率写成对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 严格小于某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,1]\">\\([0,1]\\)</span> 值的可忽略函数。字面上，固定任意一个有限长度后可硬编码该长度的有限求逆表，使该长度成功率为1，所以这一严格全参数写法会产生退化。本条的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InvAdv}_{A,f}\\in\\mathrm{Negl}\">\\(\\operatorname{InvAdv}_{A,f}\\in\\mathrm{Negl}\\)</span> 采用通常的渐近安全条件，允许有限多个小参数成功率为1；这是明确的本地规范化，并非对该严格不等式的逐字转录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-negl","status":"resolved","id":"f3171800627deef3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-negl]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ppt]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*$，$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}$ 是均匀随机求逆算法，见 [[28-df-ppt]]；求逆输入为 $(1^n,f(x))$，二输入调用采用该文件的 $\\operatorname{tup}_2=\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 编码；$U_n$ 为 $\\Sigma^n$ 上均匀分布。概率同时取遍 $x$ 与 $A$ 的独立随机性。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-negl","status":"resolved","id":"f3171800627deef3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Negl}$ 见 [[28-df-negl]]；$\\operatorname{InvAdv}_{A,f}:\\mathbb N\\to[0,1]$；$\\mathbf{OWF}$ 为强单向函数类。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}","display":false},{"tex":"(1^n,f(x))","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tup}_2=\\operatorname{pair}_{01}","display":false},{"tex":"U_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^n","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Negl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{InvAdv}_{A,f}:\\mathbb N\\to[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{OWF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{InvAdv}_{A,f}(n)\\coloneqq\\Pr_{x\\leftarrow U_n}\\left[f\\bigl(A(1^n,f(x))\\bigr)=f(x)\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{OWF}\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathbf{FP}:\\forall A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\;\\operatorname{InvAdv}_{A,f}\\in\\mathrm{Negl}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"1^n","display":false},{"tex":"n+|f(x)|","display":false},{"tex":"f(x)","display":false},{"tex":"f(x)=\\operatorname{bin}(|x|)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"O(\\log n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{poly}(\\log n)","display":false},{"tex":"1^n","display":false},{"tex":"0^n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{InvAdv}_{A,f}\\in\\mathrm{Negl}","display":false}],"bytes":2559,"backlinks":[{"id":"5c4afc9766080d5a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$，$b\\in\\{0,1\\}$ 与单比特串 $\\langle b\\rangle$ 认同；$f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*$，$h:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathbf{OWF}$ 见 [[28-df-one-way-function]]，$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]。"},{"id":"4ef2ebb7b79718cb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathbf{OWF}$ 见 [[28-df-one-way-function]]；$f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*$。$f\\upharpoonright\\Sigma^n$ 为定义域限制。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-153","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"基础安全概念：[[28-df-ppt]]、[[28-df-negl]]、[[28-df-one-way-function]]、[[28-df-hardcore-predicate]]、[[28-df-prg]]、[[28-df-prf]]。"},{"id":"bc4db49d023a67c9","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$f\\in\\mathbf{OWF}$，见 [[28-df-one-way-function]]，且 $\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;f|_{\\Sigma^n}:\\Sigma^n\\to\\Sigma^n$ 为双射。"},{"id":"27512705907dad0b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{OWF}$ 见 [[28-df-one-way-function]]；$\\mathbf{PRG}$ 见 [[28-df-prg]]。二者均使用均匀概率多项式时间攻击者。"}],"outgoing":["f3171800627deef3","b75200f005282ddf","adb92775ec020a0b"]}